WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.310
Listen…

2
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:07.650
It's early morning in Central America.

3
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.530
There's a smell of coffee, the city is waking up…

4
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:13.590
and someone, somewhere, needs something.

5
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.070
To sell the bicycle they no longer ride.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.310
To find a plumber today.

7
00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.270
A job that pays fairly.

8
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:21.910
A meal brought to the door.

9
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.750
A word of encouragement…

10
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.990
or a puppy that changes their life.

11
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:27.370
Hello.

12
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.190
What a joy to have you here.

13
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.500
This is Yavaya: the digital home of Central America and Mexico.

14
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:36.610
One account, one reputation…

15
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.730
and a whole world inside.

16
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:42.010
In this guide I'll take you by the hand, district by district.

17
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:45.410
We'll stroll through the Mercadito, Services and Work.

18
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.150
We'll hop on YavayaGo, with its rides and errands.

19
00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:52.010
We'll step into the Community and the Violet Space.

20
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.210
We'll pause in the Sanctuary, meet the furry friends in Animals…

21
00:00:55.960 --> 00:01:00.910
and at the end I'll tell you the secret that holds it all together: trust.

22
00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:01.530
Ready?

23
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:02.370
Ready?

24
00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.370
Let's go.

25
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.130
Picture Carlos.

26
00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:09.070
He has an almost-new bicycle sitting in the yard…

27
00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:11.670
and he could really use that bit of money.

28
00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:14.130
Carlos, welcome to the Mercadito.

29
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:18.470
Here you buy and sell everything, across Central America and Mexico: vehicles,

30
00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:24.770
homes and land, electronics, fashion, things for the home, sports and classifieds.

31
00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:28.510
Posting is free, up to five active listings at a time.

32
00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:30.410
Yes, free.

33
00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:34.250
You upload your photos, write a clear title, choose your city…

34
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.470
and that's it.

35
00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.290
And the best part?

36
00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:39.350
Before you message a seller, you see their reputation.

37
00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:42.050
No more buying blind from a stranger.

38
00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:46.310
When you like something, you message them directly on WhatsApp, and payment is between you,

39
00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:47.170
in cash.

40
00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:49.030
Yavaya never touches your money.

41
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.290
Looking for something that isn't there yet?

42
00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:54.750
Save your search, and Yavaya lets you know when something new arrives.

43
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.010
And meanwhile, we look after you:

44
00:01:57.140 --> 00:02:00.370
we strip the location and camera data from every photo,

45
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.470
a person reviews every reported listing,

46
00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:06.270
and new accounts start with only a few listings,

47
00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:08.110
to slow down anyone who wants to abuse it.

48
00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:09.710
Want to sell faster?

49
00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.730
Feature your listing for seven days with tokens.

50
00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.330
But selling your things…

51
00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.730
is still free.

52
00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:19.670
So now you know: tap “Post”, and make today your first sale.

53
00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.090
It's three in the morning.

54
00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.610
The roof is dripping…

55
00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:25.180
plink…

56
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:25.750
plink…

57
00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:26.320
plink.

58
00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:27.650
Who do you call?

59
00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:29.850
That's what Services is for.

60
00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:35.230
Here you ask for what you need, and people and professionals near you respond,

61
00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:37.490
each with their reputation in plain view.

62
00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:45.030
Home and repairs, cleaning and gardening, mechanics, technology, beauty, events,

63
00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:47.850
lessons for the kids, legal paperwork…

64
00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:50.110
and also health, and mental health.

65
00:02:49.860 --> 00:02:51.550
Is it urgent?

66
00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:53.430
Tick “I need it today”.

67
00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:57.130
Your request is seen first by those who said they can come today.

68
00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.610
You explain what's happening, where and by when.

69
00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:06.370
You get replies, compare them, and choose by reputation, by reviews and by manner,

70
00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:07.610
not just by price.

71
00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:12.330
When it's done, you leave your review, so the next person chooses better.

72
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.270
Asking and answering are free.

73
00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.990
Something very important: a psychologist,

74
00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:24.350
a nurse or a lawyer only appears as licence-verified once a person at Yavaya has checked it.

75
00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:27.450
Until then, it says clearly: “unverified”.

76
00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:28.930
Never the other way round.

77
00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:33.650
And because a request reveals where someone lives, only members can see requests.

78
00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.770
Do you have a trade, a profession, hands that work magic?

79
00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:40.230
Create your profile and offer your services.

80
00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:43.390
Your next client is closer than you think.

81
00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:46.590
Picture Sofía.

82
00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.490
A designer, talented…

83
00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:51.270
and tired of job offers that don't say what they pay.

84
00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.870
Or worse: that ask her for money to apply.

85
00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:56.990
Sofía, this is for you.

86
00:03:57.460 --> 00:04:02.790
Welcome to Work: jobs and professional projects, in your city or remote.

87
00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:05.730
Here every offer says what it pays.

88
00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:06.510
Always.

89
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:11.810
No auctions and no price wars: you apply with your profile and a message,

90
00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.290
and whoever posted decides.

91
00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:16.110
Applying is always free.

92
00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:20.710
And one golden rule: a real job never charges you to apply,

93
00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:23.530
nor for training, nor for materials.

94
00:04:23.460 --> 00:04:25.910
If someone asks you for money, report it.

95
00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.470
On the other side,

96
00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:31.590
a person at Yavaya reviews every employer before their first offer,

97
00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:35.090
and a company always posts under its verified name.

98
00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.830
No anonymous offers.

99
00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:44.490
Technology, design, marketing, writing, finance, sales, construction, health,

100
00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.350
tourism, agriculture, transport…

101
00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:49.510
there's room for every profession.

102
00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:55.130
Create your professional profile, show your portfolio, and let your work speak for you.

103
00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.490
Hiring?

104
00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.570
Post up to two open offers, free.

105
00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.670
Because here, the winner isn't whoever charges least.

106
00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.350
It's whoever works best.

107
00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:05.510
Hungry?

108
00:05:06.260 --> 00:05:09.310
Out of bread, or need something from the pharmacy?

109
00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:15.090
This is YavayaGo: what you need, brought by someone you can trust.

110
00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:21.130
Food, groceries, pharmacy, bakery, drinks and your neighbourhood shops, all in one place.

111
00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:24.930
You choose your city, open a shop, build your order…

112
00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.190
and that's it.

113
00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:30.970
Every courier was checked by a person at Yavaya: their identity, their photo,

114
00:05:30.900 --> 00:05:34.090
their vehicle and their phone, before their first delivery.

115
00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:38.990
And while you wait, you see on the map, live, who is bringing your order: their name,

116
00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:41.090
their face, their vehicle and their plate.

117
00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:45.690
You pay on delivery, in cash, the price the shop set.

118
00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:47.450
Yavaya takes no commission.

119
00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.830
And if the order is for someone else?

120
00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:53.770
That works too: you place it, and whoever receives it pays on arrival.

121
00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:54.630
But wait…

122
00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:57.210
there's more: Rides and errands.

123
00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:00.950
A ride, a parcel, an errand, or a hand with something.

124
00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.730
You say what you'll pay.

125
00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:07.110
Nearby drivers accept your price or offer theirs, with their photo,

126
00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:08.570
their vehicle and their plate…

127
00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.390
and you choose.

128
00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:13.650
You follow it on the map, and you can share your trip with someone you trust.

129
00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.830
Everything you pay goes to the driver.

130
00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.430
We're starting in Managua.

131
00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.770
Have a business?

132
00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:20.250
Open it on YavayaGo.

133
00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:21.930
Have a motorbike or a car?

134
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.330
Deliver with us.

135
00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.070
Local, to your door.

136
00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.510
Some days are heavy.

137
00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:32.090
And some days you have exactly what someone else needs.

138
00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:34.810
The Community exists for both.

139
00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:40.210
This is Yavaya's square: a calm place to ask for a hand, offer one,

140
00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:42.190
or share what you carry inside.

141
00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.570
Nothing is charged here.

142
00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.830
Here we come to add up.

143
00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.890
Local help, for what neighbours can sort out between them.

144
00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:53.030
And family support, for a family's hard moments,

145
00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:57.310
with respect and discretion: you can post without showing your name.

146
00:06:57.740 --> 00:06:59.930
The square is for members only,

147
00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:03.550
because many posts speak of difficult moments,

148
00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:05.490
and they shouldn't be on display for everyone.

149
00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:11.890
The rules are visible and enforced: there is no place here for harassment, scams, abuse,

150
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:15.050
political fights, extremism or spam.

151
00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:18.970
And one person's need never becomes a spectacle.

152
00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.650
When someone replies to you or supports you, you get a notification.

153
00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.750
So no one is left talking to themselves.

154
00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:29.050
From the square you can also enter the Sanctuary and the Violet Space.

155
00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.190
Come in, say hello, and discover how lovely it is to have real neighbours.

156
00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:36.750
This video is for you, woman.

157
00:07:37.140 --> 00:07:41.030
For the one going through something hard, who doesn't know who to talk to.

158
00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.510
A partner who cheated on you, or left you.

159
00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.310
A pregnancy you're facing alone.

160
00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.590
Abuse.

161
00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:49.110
Anxiety.

162
00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:50.690
A sadness that won't go away.

163
00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:52.910
You don't have to carry it alone.

164
00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:59.230
This is the Violet Space: a protected place, for women only, inside Yavaya.

165
00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:00.890
And it's free.

166
00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:05.670
Here you get a name that exists only in this space, like “Luna 27”.

167
00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.250
Your Yavaya name is never shown.

168
00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:13.790
Everything you write is stored encrypted, and no one on the team has a screen to read it.

169
00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:16.430
A private conversation belongs to two people only.

170
00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:20.230
And nothing from here reaches your notifications or your email.

171
00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:25.550
Room messages delete themselves after 30 days, and private ones after 90.

172
00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.670
You can delete your own whenever you like.

173
00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:32.190
And if you need to leave fast, one button takes you out instantly…

174
00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:34.090
or press Escape twice.

175
00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:38.230
Psychology and psychiatry professionals listen here too,

176
00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:39.970
with verified licences.

177
00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:44.570
And we tell you the truth: the encryption is not end-to-end,

178
00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:49.810
and we can't confirm that every person is a woman; anyone who lies is expelled.

179
00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:54.990
If you are in danger right now, get somewhere safe and call emergency services.

180
00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:57.150
Here, no woman is alone.

181
00:08:58.660 --> 00:08:59.990
Eight in the morning.

182
00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:01.150
You open your eyes…

183
00:09:00.900 --> 00:09:02.830
and a light is waiting for you.

184
00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:07.290
Welcome to the Sanctuary: the district of faith.

185
00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:13.410
Every morning at 8, “Today's light” arrives: a prayer, a proverb,

186
00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:15.470
a saying or a blessing.

187
00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:21.290
It's from Yavaya for everyone, whatever they believe, and there's a new one for every day of the year.

188
00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.810
And you choose what you want to receive.

189
00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:25.390
Only prayers?

190
00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:26.850
Only proverbs?

191
00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.190
You tick your boxes…

192
00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.930
and that's it.

193
00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.650
The churches are here too,

194
00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:35.770
and each one was reviewed by a person at Yavaya before appearing.

195
00:09:36.140 --> 00:09:41.330
Find yours, follow it, and you'll see its schedule and the word it shares each day.

196
00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:46.530
Those words aren't written by Yavaya: each one is signed by its church.

197
00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:48.030
Do you lead a congregation?

198
00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:53.790
Registering your church is free, and it's done by its pastor, its priest or its leader.

199
00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:57.590
And when the heart is heavy, there's the prayer wall.

200
00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:02.870
You share your request, even without showing your name, and others pray with you.

201
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.630
Because sometimes, what we need most…

202
00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:08.130
is to know someone is praying for us.

203
00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.230
Come in.

204
00:10:09.340 --> 00:10:11.110
There's always a place for you here.

205
00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:13.910
Look at that little face.

206
00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.990
How could you not fall in love?

207
00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:21.550
Welcome to Animals, where every animal deserves a safe home.

208
00:10:21.840 --> 00:10:23.750
Here, adopting isn't a click.

209
00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:24.990
It's a journey…

210
00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.650
and it's beautiful.

211
00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:32.330
First you learn: a guide to responsible care, on feeding, vaccines,

212
00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:35.870
neutering, space and handling, with its quiz.

213
00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.970
When you pass it, you get your certificate.

214
00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:44.290
Then, you adopt: rescued animals looking for a family, with no price,

215
00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.210
through a full application.

216
00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:49.630
Who you are, what your home is like, whether you have other animals.

217
00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:52.230
And the person who rescued it chooses the home.

218
00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:56.230
After a month, Yavaya reminds you to say hello, to see how it's doing.

219
00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:57.830
Do you rescue animals?

220
00:10:58.060 --> 00:11:03.050
Apply to be a verified rescuer, and post yours so they find a family.

221
00:11:02.800 --> 00:11:06.010
Did your animal go missing, or did you find one?

222
00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:10.670
Post it in Lost and found, and we'll let you know if a match appears.

223
00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:15.290
And if you see cruelty, alert the authorities and a rescue organisation.

224
00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.350
If it's in a Yavaya post, report it.

225
00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:22.950
All of this is free, because protecting a life should never cost anything.

226
00:11:23.060 --> 00:11:23.790
Go on…

227
00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:26.210
someone is waiting for you, wagging their tail.

228
00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:28.690
And now…

229
00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:30.910
the secret.

230
00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:36.730
Beneath every district there's something you can't see, but you can feel: trust.

231
00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:40.070
On Yavaya, one person is one account.

232
00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:45.790
Your identity is unique and permanent, with an 8-digit number that is yours alone.

233
00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:48.330
No one can start over after scamming.

234
00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:53.790
Your reputation is earned through actions: a sale completed, a delivery,

235
00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.470
a job well done, a helpful review.

236
00:11:56.220 --> 00:12:01.170
It runs from 0 to 1000, rewards consistency, not popularity…

237
00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.910
and goes with you to every district.

238
00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:08.310
New accounts go through a period of closer supervision,

239
00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:12.410
and every important action is kept in a record no one can erase.

240
00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:13.770
And tokens?

241
00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.930
They're credits for taking part, nothing more.

242
00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.830
They're not cryptocurrency, nor an investment.

243
00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:25.730
Posting is free; tokens are for featuring, or for having more listings.

244
00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:31.070
You get welcome tokens in your first week, and more when you invite your friends.

245
00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:34.710
And if you like, you can buy them from under a dollar.

246
00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:40.330
And a promise: no invented figures, no fake users, no fake reviews.

247
00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:43.410
On the Status page we tell you what works today…

248
00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:44.710
and what doesn't yet.

249
00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:48.950
And you choose your language, your light or dark theme,

250
00:12:48.940 --> 00:12:51.390
and how precisely your location is shown.

251
00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.290
Here, you're in charge.

252
00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.610
And that's Yavaya.

253
00:12:55.800 --> 00:13:01.610
A market, a trade, a job, an errand, a helping hand, a prayer…

254
00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.630
and a home for whoever needs one.

255
